Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Yeni tag button, live visitors page, product image
 management
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Products list: 🏷️ icon button to toggle 'Yeni' tag per product + YENİ badge on title
- Visitors page: real-time live visitor tracking at /visitors with funnel, traffic sources, visitor cards (city/IP/device/browser)
- Product edit: image upload (file→base64→Shopify REST) + delete per image
- New API: /api/shopify/products/[id]/images (POST/DELETE)
- New API: /api/admin/visitors (active sessions with geoip data)
- Track endpoint enhanced: captures IP + async geoip lookup (ip-api.com) on first visit
- Prisma: add ip/city/country to VisitorSession + migration
- Sidebar: add Canlı Ziyaretçiler link under Müşteriler

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
